  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Christopher Wuerz is an American software entrepreneur who founded CRW Systems, a California business specialising in technology for local government. He led the company as chief executive as its customer base expanded across North America. SunGard acquired CRW in 2015, bringing its experienced staff and management into the public-sector business.",
    "html": "<p>Christopher Wuerz is an American software entrepreneur who founded CRW Systems, a California business specialising in technology for local government. He led the company as chief executive as its customer base expanded across North America. SunGard acquired CRW in 2015, bringing its experienced staff and management into the public-sector business.</p>\r\n",
    "word_count": 50,
    "confidence": {
